# ── Supabase ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Found at: dashboard.supabase.com → Settings → API


# ── Stripe ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Found at: dashboard.stripe.com → Developers → API Keys
# Payment links go in data.js — no secret key needed for Payment Links (Option A)
# Only needed if you upgrade to Stripe Embedded Checkout 

# ── Resend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Resend is configured server-side in your Supabase Edge Function
# DO NOT put the Resend API key here — it lives in Supabase Edge Function secrets
# To set it: Supabase Dashboard → Edge Functions → notify-event-request → Secrets
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your-resend-key  ← set this in Supabase, NOT here
